snippet.textDisplay:
@JackRR15 Okay puzzle piece convention goer, let's try framing it this way instead: The idea of giving a glorified chatbot both the means and the possibility of committing great bodily harm on others is a TERRIBLE idea. Coders are only human, and human's make mistakes.  

People are trying to shoehorn this technology into everything without bothering to think about the consequences of what can and will go wrong with the technology really still being in its infancy. 

 THAT is what people are actually worried about here.

