@daviddragonheart6798 All laws require willingness and ability - I'm not talking explicitly about laws made up by a FICTION book author.

A law means nothing if said machine cannot do so - which is still the same thing.

Azimov's laws are science fiction - and if you look at the real world - are polar opposites of everything that will happen in the hands of mega corporations and power.

