snippet.textDisplay:
@jurgenolivieiraJPCOIt’s because I, like many, were introduced to alcohol way too young and also have childhood trauma, a horrible combination for a kid, and I, like many became alcoholic and addicted to drugs. When you drink and smoke herb routinely at 12, it stifles your emotional maturity in a way.
We chase not only the high, but also that lack of responsibility feeling we had as we partied as teenagers.
It messed us up. I’m 10 years sober today.

